# Hand-maintained file manifest — a data dep of the Ζ·starlark-generated @paperkit_render check
# graph; the bib is the source, this just lists the files.  render is a MIXED-TIER project (Ζ·tier):
# its pure compliance warrants (wcag_model, matrix, cube, use_of_colour, the format selector) are
# sandbox-gated and mutation-swept in //:hook; its render/oracle warrants are `tier = {toolchain}`
# (deterministic given a pinned toolchain — pandoc/veraPDF/lualatex/soffice — carried by the
# executor image in pool `paperkit` (image/executor/Containerfile), cached + stamped with that
# image's digest, enforceable every commit AND fast).
# ⚑ checks/render.sh was MISSING from this manifest until 2026-09-21: its warrant ran `tier = local`
# on the live tree, so the omission was invisible until the claim moved into a staged cell and the
# calc baseline said `sh: 0: cannot open checks/render.sh` — a hand-kept roster drifts exactly where
# nothing reads it.
filegroup(name = "files", srcs = [
